ind":"update","title":"Tutorial Hotfix","summary":"Small hotfix: The improved tutorial has now actually made it into the game. Apparently, even our alien hive struggles with version control sometimes. 🧬","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-21T18:40:06Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114029967","verified_at":"2026-10-21T19:27:19Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4920840-1846651706696246","game_id":"steam-4920840","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update: A Clearer Start in Xenogarden","summary":"Thanks for your feedback! The opening threw too much information at you at once. The updated HUD now highlights essential resources and your current objective, with extra details available when you need them. Larger descriptions and small info icons in the build bar help explain your buildings.The tutorial flows more smoothly, with fewer confirmation clicks, clearly highlighted building tasks, and a better-paced first attack. Healing Blooms, Lure Blooms, and Living Walls now have their own tutor","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-20T17:52:26Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706696246","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:49:16Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4920840-1846651706693001","game_id":"steam-4920840","kind":"update","title":"Xenogarden at Steam Next Fest – Demo Update! 🌱","summary":"We’ve made several improvements to the Xenogarden demo for Steam Next Fest:More time to prepare: Final Bloom now gives you 60 seconds before the first wave on Easy and Normal. Hard stays at 34 seconds.Updated creature animations and improved combat behavior.Improved menus: An easy-to-reach Quit button on the main menu and a confirmation dialog before leaving a run or quitting during gameplay.Try the demo and share your feedback in the Steam discussions! If you enjoy Xenogarden, please consider a","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T22:56:29Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706693001","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:49:16Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4920840-1846651706678277","game_id":"steam-4920840","kind":"update","title":"Xenogarden – Combat & Evolution Update","summary":"We've been busy improving Xenogarden's visuals, combat, performance, and enemy behavior. This update brings a major step forward for the demo, making battles more dynamic, creatures more detailed, and enemy assaults considerably more dangerous.What's New?🧬 Enhanced 3D CreaturesUpdated creature and enemy models with improved visual detail.Refined animations and more consistent creature presentation.Optimized 3D rendering to handle larger groups of units more efficiently.⚔️ More Impactful CombatHe","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-15T15:51:35Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706678277","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:49:16Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4920840-1846018067928647","game_id":"steam-4920840","kind":"announcement","title":"The Xenogarden Demo is Now Live!","summary":"Grow your hive, spread your synapses, assimilate the world around you, and defend your heart against increasingly dangerous waves.The demo gives you a first taste of Xenogarden's core gameplay and of what we want to expand further as development continues.If you give it a try, we'd love to hear your feedback, bug reports, and impressions.Thank you to everyone who has followed and supported Xenogarden so far. 🌱See you in the garden.— Xenogarden","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-08T07:34:21Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067928647","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:49:16Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4920840-1843481262699101","game_id":"steam-4920840","kind":"announcement","title":"Your Army Is Alive. What Will You Grow?","summary":"Your army is alive.In Xenogarden, Guardians evolve into specialized brood: armored defenders, relentless hunters, venom carriers and living healers.Every form has a purpose. Every strength has a trade-off.Which brood would you grow?Why build evolution this way?I want growing your army to feel like shaping a living colony. Armor buys staying power at the cost of speed. Hunters chase exposed prey. Healers keep the brood alive.The goal is a brood whose roles support each other.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-13T09:39:54Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262699101","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:49:16Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4920840-1842846814451900","game_id":"steam-4920840","kind":"announcement","title":"A new Xenogarden gameplay trailer is here.","summary":"This time, the focus is on the game itself: grow your living colony, assimilate human structures, defend the Heart and command Selqara's swarm.The footage comes directly from the current playable build and shows colony growth, assimilation, combat, abilities and the living battlefield in action. A little look behind the vinesPart of the footage was actually captured by the same AI agent that helps us work on Xenogarden. It launched the game, played it, recorded multiple takes, noticed when a cap","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-07T00:33:48Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814451900","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:49:16Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4920840-1840944183781780","game_id":"steam-4920840","kind":"announcement","title":"Auralis – The Crystal Chorus","summary":"Where Selquara protects her garden with thorns and Veyra subjects everything to the hunger of her brood, Auralis represents something different:Order. Resonance. Perfect growth.Her crystals are neither ordinary minerals nor traditional ice magic. They are living tissue – structures grown by the hive itself, transforming biological matter into something almost unnatural: hard, precise, and strangely beautiful.Auralis herself appears distant. Calmer than the other leaders, almost emotionless.But c","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-15T09:54:17Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183781780","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:49:16Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4920840-1839676055892468","game_id":"steam-4920840","kind":"announcement","title":"Veyra – Matriarch of the Brood","summary":"Today, I would like to introduce another leader from Xenogarden: Veyra.While Selquara represents thorns, control, and a slowly growing defensive network, Veyra embodies a far more restless side of the hive. Her theme revolves around brood, poison, and biological adaptation.Veyra does not see the Xenogarden as a fortress. To her, it is a living organism that must constantly evolve. Her creatures are meant to pressure the enemy, contaminate territory, and remain dangerous long after the initial co","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-02T11:28:59Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839676055892468","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:49:16Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4920840-1839041357033713","game_id":"steam-4920840","kind":"announcement","title":"Selquara – The Garden Grows Thorns","summary":"One important thing first: Selquara is not a traditional hero character walking around the battlefield. Instead, she changes the direction of the entire garden. Her focus is clearly on Thorn Towers, strong defensive growth, and a network that becomes increasingly unpleasant for attackers the further it spreads.Since you cannot simply select your creatures in Xenogarden and send them after individual enemies, the way you build your colony plays a much larger role.Where do you expand your Synaptic","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-26T12:50:09Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839041357033713","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:49:16Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4920840-1838407329259072","game_id":"steam-4920840","kind":"announcement","title":"Xenogarden Roadmap – The Swarm Grows","summary":"The Xenogarden continues to grow.The next major stage begins with the Steam Next Fest demo in October 2026. Afterwards, Xenogarden is planned to enter Early Access and continue evolving through testing and player feedback. \\October 2026 – Steam Next Fest Demo\\The first public demo will provide a focused introduction to Xenogarden and its core systems.• One playable leader• One handcrafted demo mission• Growing and expanding the living network• Defending the heart of the colony• Infecting and ass","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-17T10:30:50Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1838407329259072","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:49:16Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4920840":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T05:12:19Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T05:12:18Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4920840":"2026-10-26T05:12:19Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4920840":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T05:12:18Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T05:12:18Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"5238850":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T05:12:19Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T05:12:19Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4920840","app_id":4920840,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:15:08Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"47b0d43f66ddb37092ab3519938ed05deff745f5a63bcfad9b8601f0ffef57a5","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"Xenogarden is a dark sci-fi strategy game where you spread an alien swarm, build synapse nodes, defend your core, and overwhelm human defenders before they destroy your living network and cut the invasion apart.","publishers":[{"name":"Abyssal Bloom Games"}],"developers":[{"name":"Abyssal Bloom Games"}]},"release":{"is_coming_soon":true,"custom_release_date_message":"출시 예정","coming_soon_display":"text_comingsoon","is_early_access":true},"trailers":{"highlights":[{"trailer_name":"Xenogarden Gameplay","trailer_url_format":"steam/apps/${FILENAME}?t=1792876260","trailer_category":1,"microtrailer":[{"filename":"4920840/727405029/09e281f8ef59dcffce4b2a4f9348fa2dc3ab0b37/1792875852/microtrailer.webm","type":"video/webm"},{"filename":"4920840/727405029/09e281f8ef59dcffce4b2a4f9348fa2dc3ab0b37/1792875852/microtrailer.mp4","type":"video/mp4"}],"adaptive_trailers":[{"cdn_path":"4920840/727405029/09e281f8ef59dcffce4b2a4f9348fa2dc3ab0b37/1792875852/dash_av1.mpd